      "comment": "Converts YUV color data to RGB format using MMX SIMD instructions and lookup tables.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load MMX rounding constant and initialize chroma buffer pointers (U and V)\n2. Calculate destination buffer end address (current + nPixelStride * 8 pixels)  \n3. For each pixel pair in first buffer region:\n   a. Read 32-bit YUV pixel from destination buffer\n   b. Extract Y components and subtract bias using MMX PSUBUSW\n   c. Shift Y values left by 2 bits and multiply by conversion constant\n   d. Load U and V chroma values from separate buffers\n   e. Lookup RGB coefficients from tables using U/V as indices\n   f. Combine Y*coefficient + chroma offset for each RGB component\n   g. Apply saturation and rounding using PADDSW/PSUBUSW operations\n   h. Pack RGB values into 32-bit format with proper bit positioning\n   i. Store duplicated pixels to destination buffer (8 pixels per iteration)\n4. Update buffer pointers and repeat for second buffer region\n5. Clean up MMX state and return\n\nParameters:\nnPixelStride - int - Number of pixel pairs to process per scan line stride\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value, results written directly to global buffers\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x04 - Chroma buffer increment (2 pixels * 2 bytes)\n0x20 - Destination buffer increment (32 bytes = 8 pixels * 4 bytes)\n0x02 - Y component shift multiplier for brightness scaling\n0x08 - Red channel shift (8 bits) in packed RGB format\n0x10 - Blue channel shift (16 bits) in packed RGB format\n\nError Handling:\nNone - Function assumes valid buffer pointers and sufficient memory\n\nGlobal Buffers:\ng_pChromaBufferU - Pointer to U chroma component buffer\ng_pChromaBufferV - Pointer to V chroma component buffer  \ng_pSrcBufferCurrent - Pointer to current RGB output buffer\ng_pSrcBufferEnd - Pointer to end RGB output buffer\ng_pDstBufferCurrent - Pointer to current YUV input buffer\ng_pDstBufferEnd - Pointer to end YUV input buffer\ng_adRedLookupTable - Red component conversion lookup table\ng_adGreenLookupTable - Green component conversion lookup table  \ng_adBlueLookupTable - Blue component conversion lookup table\ng_adGreenChromaTable - Green chroma adjustment lookup table\ng_qwMmxRoundingConstant - MMX rounding constant (64-bit)\ng_qwMmxZeroMask - MMX zero mask for unsigned saturation (64-bit)\ng_qwMmxMultiplier - MMX Y-component multiplier constant (64-bit)",
