      "name": "GetNormalizedValue",
      "signature": "uint GetNormalizedValue(ComObject * pComObject)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Calls COM object method to get a value and normalizes it by dividing by the object's divisor field.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call virtual method at vtable offset 0x10 to retrieve a value\n2. Pass pointer to object, address of parameter, and output buffer as arguments\n3. Check method result for failure (negative values)\n4. Return error code 0xffffffff on method failure\n5. Divide retrieved value by object's divisor field at offset 0xc\n6. Return normalized result\n\nParameters:\npComObject - Pointer to COM object containing vtable and divisor field\n\nReturns:\nOn success: Normalized value (retrieved value / divisor)\nOn failure: 0xffffffff (error code)\n\nSpecial Cases:\nMethod result < 0 triggers early error return\nDivision by zero potential if divisor field is 0\n\nStructure Layout:\nComObject (16 bytes):\nOffset  Size  Field Name   Type              Description\n+0x00   4     pVTable      IUnknownVTable*   Pointer to virtual function table\n+0x04   4     field4       uint              Unknown field\n+0x08   4     field8       uint              Unknown field  \n+0x0c   4     dwDivisor    uint              Divisor value for normalization\n\nIUnknownVTable (20 bytes):\nOffset  Size  Field Name       Type    Description\n+0x00   4     QueryInterface   void*   Standard COM QueryInterface\n+0x04   4     AddRef          void*   Standard COM AddRef\n+0x08   4     Release         void*   Standard COM Release\n+0x0c   4     Method3         void*   Custom method\n+0x10   4     GetValue        void*   Method to retrieve value for normalization",
