      "name": "ConfigureBinkDisplayMode",
      "signature": "bool ConfigureBinkDisplayMode(HWND hwndParent, bool fEnable)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "bool",
      "comment": "Configure Bink video display mode and collect system display metrics.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Early exit if DirectDraw is already active (g_dwDirectDrawFlags != 0)\n2. Validate required parameters: fEnable must be true and all buffer dimensions valid\n3. Construct DEVMODE structure with current Bink buffer settings (width, height, color depth)\n4. Attempt primary display mode change with flag 0x1c0000 (CDS_UPDATEREGISTRY | CDS_NORESET)\n5. If primary attempt fails, try fallback with flag 0x180000 (CDS_FULLSCREEN)\n6. If either attempt succeeds, set g_fDisplayModeActive = true\n7. Clear all Bink buffer global settings (width=0, height=0, depth=0)\n8. Collect system metrics: screen width, height, pixel depth, video memory size\n9. Increment Bink instance counter (g_dwBinkInstanceCount)\n\nParameters:\nhwndParent - Parent window handle for display device context operations\nfEnable - Enable flag; if false, function validates parameters then proceeds to metrics collection\n\nReturns:\ntrue (1) - Always returns success after completing metrics collection\nfalse (0) - Only returned early if DirectDraw already active\n\nSpecial Cases:\nIf any required buffer parameter is 0 (width/height/depth), skips display mode change\nand proceeds directly to system metrics collection.\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x1c0000 - CDS_UPDATEREGISTRY | CDS_NORESET (primary display change flags)\n0x180000 - CDS_FULLSCREEN (fallback display change flags)  \n0x94 - DEVMODE structure size (148 bytes)\n0x4 - CDS_TEST flag for ChangeDisplaySettingsA\n0x0 - SM_CXSCREEN (system metric for screen width)\n0x1 - SM_CYSCREEN (system metric for screen height)\n0xe - BITSPIXEL (device capability for bits per pixel)\n0xc - PLANES (device capability for color planes)\n\nStructure Layout:\nDEVMODE fields constructed on stack:\nOffset | Size | Field Name    | Type   | Description\n-------|------|---------------|--------|-------------\n+0x00  | 2    | dmSize        | ushort | Structure size (0x94)\n+0x04  | 4    | dmFields      | uint   | Field validity flags\n+0x20  | 4    | dmPelsWidth   | uint   | Display width in pixels\n+0x24  | 4    | dmPelsHeight  | uint   | Display height in pixels  \n+0x40  | 4    | dmBitsPerPel  | uint   | Color depth in bits per pixel",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:286ffbb1c957324283eefc5784bd7a18",
