      "name": "InitializeDirectSoundInterface",
      "signature": "int InitializeDirectSoundInterface(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Initialize DirectSound interface for audio playback with reference counting.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if DirectSound function pointer is available (g_pfnDirectSoundCreate)\n2. Increment reference counter (g_dwInitRefCount) \n3. If first initialization (counter == 1):\n   a. Create DirectSound interface if g_fEnableDirectSound flag is set\n   b. Call DirectSound creation function with parameters (0, &g_pDirectSoundInterface, 0)\n   c. Get window handle from FindAndCacheMainWindow() \n   d. Set cooperative level via vtable call with level 2\n   e. Initialize 96-byte format structure with zeros\n   f. Set first dword of format structure to 0x60 (96 decimal)\n   g. Call GetCaps method via vtable to retrieve capabilities\n   h. Extract bit 5 from returned capabilities and store in g_fCapabilityFlag\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\n1 - Success (DirectSound interface initialized or reference incremented)\n0 - Failure (null function pointer or DirectSound creation failed)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns 0 immediately if g_pfnDirectSoundCreate (DirectSound function pointer) is null\n- Decrements reference counter on DirectSound creation failure\n- Only performs actual initialization on first call (reference count 1)\n- Subsequent calls just increment reference counter and return success\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x60 (96) - Size of DirectSound format structure in bytes\n0x18 (24) - Number of 4-byte elements in format buffer  \n0x5 - Bit position for capability flag extraction\n0x1 - Bit mask for capability flag\n2 - DirectSound cooperative level parameter\n\nSSA Temporaries:\nNote: Function uses compiler-generated SSA variables optimized by decompiler:\n- pvVar1: Pointer iterator for format buffer initialization\n- extraout_EAX: Register output value from vtable calls\n- iVar2, uVar3: Intermediate calculation results\n- unaff_EDI: Unaffected EDI register containing capability flags\n\nGlobal Variables:\ng_pfnDirectSoundCreate - DirectSound function pointer (CreateDirectSound)\ng_dwInitRefCount - Reference counter for initialization calls  \ng_fEnableDirectSound - Flag controlling DirectSound creation\ng_pDirectSoundInterface - DirectSound interface object pointer storage\ng_fCooperativeLevelSet - Success flag for cooperative level setting\ng_fCapabilityFlag - Extracted capability flag (bit 5 from GetCaps result)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
