      "name": "FinalizeObject",
      "signature": "void FinalizeObject(BinkObject * pObject)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Finalizes a BinkObject by calling its virtual cleanup method and setting completion status.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Dereference pObject to get vtable pointer from offset 0x0\n2. Call virtual cleanup method at vtable offset 0x48 with object pointer\n3. Set completion flag at object offset 0x34 to 1 (0x00000001)\n\nParameters:\npObject: Pointer to BinkObject structure to finalize\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Function performs cleanup operations without return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x48 (72 decimal): Offset in vtable to cleanup/finalization virtual method\n0x34 (52 decimal): Offset in BinkObject to completion/initialized status flag  \n0x01: Completion status value indicating object is finalized\n\nStructure Layout:\nBinkObject (712 bytes total):\nOffset  Size  Field Name         Type        Description\n0x00    4     vtablePtr          void**      Pointer to virtual method table\n0x34    4     completionFlag     uint        Finalization status (0=pending, 1=complete)\n...     ...   ...                ...         (Other fields not accessed by this function)",
