      "name": "ReleaseDirectDrawResources",
      "signature": "void ReleaseDirectDrawResources(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Releases DirectDraw and Direct3D resources through reference counting.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Decrement global DirectDraw reference counter (g_dwDirectDrawFlags)\n2. Check if reference count reached zero\n3. If zero, call Release() method on D3D device interface (offset +8 in vtable)\n4. Call Release() method on DirectDraw interface (offset +8 in vtable) \n5. Clear global pointers g_lpDirectDraw and g_lpD3DDevice to prevent use-after-free\n6. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\nNone - operates on global state\n\nReturns:\nvoid - no return value, cleanup always attempted\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If reference count > 0, function returns immediately without cleanup\n- Both D3D device and DirectDraw interfaces assumed valid when count reaches 0\n- No error handling - assumes Release() calls succeed\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x8 (8) - Offset to IUnknown::Release() method in COM vtable",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
