      "name": "InitializeFloatingPointOpsTable",
      "signature": "void InitializeFloatingPointOpsTable(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initialize the floating-point operations function pointer table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize pFloatConvert field with address of __cfltcvt function\n2. Initialize pFloatInitialize field with address of LAB_1001deb8\n3. Initialize pFloatAssign field with address of __fassign function\n4. Initialize pFloatOperation field with address of FUN_1001de5e\n5. Initialize pFloatHandler field with address of LAB_1001df06\n6. Initialize pFloatConvert2 field with duplicate __cfltcvt function address\n\nParameters:\n   None\n\nReturns:\n   void - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n   - __cfltcvt function pointer is assigned to two different table entries\n   - Function is called during system initialization to set up floating-point runtime\n\nStructure Layout:\n   Offset | Size | Field Name        | Type    | Description\n   -------|------|-------------------|---------|-------------------------------------\n   0x00   | 4    | pFloatConvert     | void *  | Pointer to __cfltcvt function\n   0x04   | 4    | pFloatInitialize  | void *  | Pointer to initialization routine\n   0x08   | 4    | pFloatAssign      | void *  | Pointer to __fassign function\n   0x0C   | 4    | pFloatOperation   | void *  | Pointer to operation handler\n   0x10   | 4    | pFloatHandler     | void *  | Pointer to handler routine\n   0x14   | 4    | pFloatConvert2    | void *  | Duplicate __cfltcvt pointer\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n   0x1001e223 - Address of __cfltcvt function\n   0x1001deb8 - Address of LAB_1001deb8 routine\n   0x1001df1e - Address of __fassign function\n   0x1001de5e - Address of FUN_1001de5e operation\n   0x1001df06 - Address of LAB_1001df06 handler\n   0x1002e498 - Base address of FloatingPointOps table",
