      "name": "ProcessChromaInterleave",
      "signature": "int ProcessChromaInterleave(int nWidthPixels, int nHeightPixels)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Processes YUV420 chroma interleaving by combining U and V components into packed 32-bit pixel format for both current and end buffer scanlines.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize loop counter (nPixelsRemaining) from nWidthPixels \n2. Decrement counter by 2 pixels per iteration (processes 2 pixels at once)\n3. Read U byte from g_pChromaBufferU[0] \n4. Read V byte from g_pChromaBufferV[0]\n5. Read Y0 byte from g_pDstBufferCurrent[0] \n6. Read Y1 byte from g_pDstBufferCurrent[1]\n7. Pack bytes into 32-bit format: VYUY (V, Y1, U, Y0) using CONCAT operations\n8. Store packed pixel to current scanline: *g_pSrcBufferCurrent \n9. Store packed pixel to stride offset: *(g_pSrcBufferCurrent + g_dwPixelStride)\n10. Read Y2 byte from g_pDstBufferEnd[0]\n11. Read Y3 byte from g_pDstBufferEnd[1]  \n12. Pack bytes into 32-bit format: VYUY (V, Y3, U, Y2) using bit operations\n13. Store packed pixel to end scanline: *g_pSrcBufferEnd\n14. Store packed pixel to stride offset: *(g_pSrcBufferEnd + g_dwPixelStride)\n15. Advance all pointers: U+1, V+1, current+2, end+2, src current+1, src end+1\n16. Continue while nPixelsRemaining > 0\n17. Return total processed pixels (nWidthPixels + nHeightPixels)\n\nParameters:\n- nWidthPixels: Width of the image region in pixels to process\n- nHeightPixels: Height of the image region in pixels to process  \n\nReturns:\n- Total processed pixels (nWidthPixels + nHeightPixels) as verification count\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Processes 2 pixels per iteration, assumes even width \n- Accesses both current and end buffer scanlines simultaneously\n- Uses global stride value (g_dwPixelStride) for interlaced access patterns\n\nGlobal Variables:\n- g_pChromaBufferU: Pointer to U chroma component buffer (advances +1 per iteration)\n- g_pChromaBufferV: Pointer to V chroma component buffer (advances +1 per iteration)  \n- g_pDstBufferCurrent: Pointer to current scanline Y data (advances +2 per iteration)\n- g_pDstBufferEnd: Pointer to end scanline Y data (advances +2 per iteration)\n- g_pSrcBufferCurrent: Pointer to packed output current scanline (advances +1 per iteration)\n- g_pSrcBufferEnd: Pointer to packed output end scanline (advances +1 per iteration)\n- g_dwPixelStride: Byte stride for interlaced buffer access patterns\n\nPixel Format:\n- Input: YUV420 planar (Y, U, V separate)  \n- Output: VYUY packed format (32-bit: V Y1 U Y0)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:c58cd330e598080efbebd364b324fdca",
