      "name": "EnsureContextInitialized",
      "signature": "bool EnsureContextInitialized(InitContext * pInitContext)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "bool",
      "comment": "Ensures that audio initialization context is properly initialized and returns status\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if handle field (offset 0x48) is uninitialized (-1)\n2. If uninitialized, call handle retrieval function with identifier (offset 0x44)\n3. Store returned handle in context structure (offset 0x48)\n4. Check if both initialization status (offset 0x24) and secondary flag (offset 0x54) are zero\n5. If both are zero, call audio initialization function with 5 parameters\n6. If initialization succeeds, set initialization status flag (offset 0x24) to 1\n7. Return whether handle field is not -1 (initialization successful)\n\nParameters:\npInitContext (InitContext *): Pointer to initialization context structure containing:\n  - dwInitStatus (offset 0x24): Initialization status flag\n  - dwIdentifier (offset 0x44): Identifier used for handle retrieval\n  - dwHandle (offset 0x48): Handle result (-1 if uninitialized)\n  - dwSecondaryFlag (offset 0x54): Secondary status flag\n\nReturns:\nbool: true if context is successfully initialized (handle != -1), false otherwise\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If handle is already initialized (not -1), skip handle retrieval\n- Audio initialization only occurs if both status flags are zero\n- Function is idempotent - safe to call multiple times\n\nStructure Layout:\n| Offset | Size | Field Name      | Type | Description                    |\n|--------|------|-----------------|------|--------------------------------|\n| 0x24   | 4    | dwInitStatus    | uint | Initialization status flag    |\n| 0x44   | 4    | dwIdentifier    | uint | Identifier for handle lookup  |\n| 0x48   | 4    | dwHandle        | uint | Retrieved handle (-1 if unset)|\n| 0x54   | 4    | dwSecondaryFlag | uint | Secondary status flag         |\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0xFFFFFFFF (-1): Uninitialized handle sentinel value\n0x01: Successful initialization status flag\n0x24 (36): Offset to initialization status field\n0x44 (68): Offset to identifier field\n0x48 (72): Offset to handle field\n0x54 (84): Offset to secondary flag field",
